    <summary>A tray icon that lights up when your coding agent finishes or needs you</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
A speech bubble in the notification area for Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI
and Devin.

* Turns green when a session finishes, with a notification.
* Turns amber when an agent is blocked on a permission prompt or a question.
* Lists every open session by project folder, most urgent first; click one to
  bring its terminal forward.
* Stays quiet for quick turns and for prompts you answer right away.
* Adds its hooks to each installed agent's settings, and the uninstaller
  removes them.

A single small executable with no runtime dependencies.
]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/kidchenko/suavez/releases</releaseNotes>
